# Unreal-generated data. Keep source assets and build configuration in Git.
/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/
/Builds/
/Build/**/FileOpenOrder/
/Plugins/**/Binaries/

# Historical test projects, source snapshots and generated task artifacts.
/work/
/Source/.codex-artifacts/
/Source/tmp/
/Source/output/
/DesignDocs/**/backup/
/DesignDocs/**/modified/
/DesignDocs/**/MODIFIED_FILE.zip
/Docs/cache-cleanup-*/
/Docs/local-git-setup-*/

